{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/205191-changeling-the-dreaming-music","id":205191,"title":"Changeling: The Dreaming Music","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-22T11:56:04-07:00","id":205191,"title":"Changeling: The Dreaming Music","content":"I've been listening to/watching some music videos lately to get me in the proper mindset to plan my next Changeling game. I figured others might enjoy my inspirational material for the struggle between the fantastic and mundane.<br /> <br /> <b>Carnival by the Cruxshadows</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=od0bI1eJ0C0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=od0bI1eJ0C0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=od0bI1eJ0C0 </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=od0bI1eJ0C0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=od0bI1eJ0C0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The Cruxshadows are always good for the classic World of Darkness, and this one exemplifies the Dreaming and Earth interacting.<br /> <br /> <b>Riding a Black Unicorn by Voltaire</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yjJDBP292rM\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yjJDBP292rM\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yjJDBP292rM </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yjJDBP292rM\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yjJDBP292rM </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> This one might as well be the Changeling: The Dreaming theme song <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Radioactive by Imagine Dragons</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ktvTqknDobU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ktvTqknDobU\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ktvTqknDobU </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ktvTqknDobU\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ktvTqknDobU </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Revenge of the pink teddy bear! Grind the chimera under your heel all you want. They will get the final say.<br /> <br /> <b>We Are Young by Fun</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sv6dMFF_yts\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sv6dMFF_yts\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sv6dMFF_yts </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sv6dMFF_yts\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sv6dMFF_yts </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Time is short. Live it up while you can. It's far better to burn out than fade away.<br /> <br /> <b>Uprising by Muse</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w8KQmps-Sog\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w8KQmps-Sog\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w8KQmps-Sog </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w8KQmps-Sog\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w8KQmps-Sog </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Banality can not contain the Dreaming. It's time for the Kithain to rise up and reclaim their birthright.<br /> <br /> <b>The Meaning of Life by The Offspring</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=avCteSZK-Ec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=avCteSZK-Ec\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=avCteSZK-Ec </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=avCteSZK-Ec\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=avCteSZK-Ec </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The beaten path is just another name for a rut. That way lies banality.<br /> <br /> So what are some of everyone else's music/music video inspiration for Changeling?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","user":"PookaKnight","date":". 07-22-2014, 02:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T17:49:24-07:00","id":205478,"title":"","content":"Also, this guy is totally a satyr or a redcap!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K-Op1Mng4oY\" data-code=\"K-Op1Mng4oY\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/K-Op1Mng4oY/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts: